st","适用方向","ordered",false,[79,80],"dimensions","2D","3D","开发阶段",[84,85,86],"stages","玩法与代码","引擎与场景","测试验证","主题",[90,91,92,93],"tags","Unity","MCP","Editor automation","Community tool","项目源码",[96],{"_54":94,"_25":60},"用途与特点","向 MCP 客户端暴露场景、GameObject、组件、Prefab、日志和 Unity Test Runner 等操作。它不同于 Unity 官方插件。README 提醒，进入带域重载的 Play Mode 可能断开桥接，需检查安装版本、测试配置及实际结果；编辑器自动操作并不等于玩法正确。","detail","guidance","资源类型","工具","分类","3D 开发","category","lead","summary","name","3d","tool",[90,91,92,93],[115,116,117],[114,109],"2d","code","scene","test",{"_119":120},"documents",{"_67":121,"_35":122},[124,128,129,130,127,131,132,133,134,135,136,137,138,139,140,141,142,143,144,145,146,147,148,149,150,151,152,153,154,155,156,157,158,159,160,161,162,126,163,125,164,165,166,167,168,169,170,171,172,173,174,175,176,177,178,179,180,181],[123,124,125,126,127],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay-state-contracts","agent-interface-evidence","catalog-review-coverage","source-revision-notes","community-case-research","overview","catalog","contributing","media-sources","icon-sources","content-model","skills/level-design/SKILL","skills/level-design/LICENSE","skills/level-design/references/blockout-metrics","skills/level-design/references/case-studies","skills/level-design/references/combat-balance","skills/level-design/refe